   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **instrument tuning**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance; with band members [2]\n- **intro (Electricity )**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Greenhouse Heat Death**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Doom City**: with \"Crumbling Castle\" outro [2]\n- **D-Day**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Welcome To An Altered Future**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **The River (medley)**: with snippets of \"Am I In Heaven?\", \"Head On/Pill\" [2]\n- **Robot Stop**: with intro \"Master Of The Universe\" [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: The Fourth Colour [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2018-03-11** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 99 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Guests: \"Crumbling Castle\" outro, band members, intro \"Master Of The Universe\", snippets of \"Am I In Heaven?\", \"Head On/Pill\" [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2018-03-11**: taped by John Porno; transferred by John Porno; source: Church Audio CA-11 > Edirol R-09HR [1]",
